 field, including wording, options, activation, and official and\r\noperational guidance, as authoritative. Domain receipts remain usable while you\r\ninvestigate or commit another Domain in the same Trial, provided the approved\r\nResult, pack, preview, and requested Domain checkpoint stay unchanged. Search\r\nresults and unrelated Domain commits do not invalidate an existing page chain.\r\nContinuation cursors are short, opaque, server-bound handle:\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-legal-memorandum\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-legal-memorandum\",\"title\":\"Legal Memorandum\",\"description\":\"Create a document using the Legal Memorandum template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Legal Memorandum. Draft legal memoranda with the issue, brief answer, relevant facts, analysis, and conclusion.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdbf4819196907b35a4560c72\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-legal-memorandum\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-market-trends-report\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-market-trends-report\",\"title\":\"Market Trends Report\",\"description\":\"Create a presentation using the Market Trends Report template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Market…15878 tokens truncated…eta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"Plugin_054ff933a434819187c4f95db80afc7f\",\"plugin_name\":\"life-sciences-databases\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a863384899c81918c9595d52e142600\",\"plugin_release